      "upaparva_name": "विष्णुपर्व",
      "adhyaya_name": "कालयवनं प्रति शालवगमनम्-०५२",
      "combined_translation": "22-47"
    },
    {
      "verse": 23,
      "sanskrit": "सृजतो बाहुवीर्येण कः पुमान्प्रसहिष्यति। अयं तु पुरुषः कृष्णो ह्यनादिनिधनोऽव्ययः॥२३॥",
      "english": "Spreading both of his sweeping wings, assuming the speed of a tempest, garuDa with a single bump of his chest knocked काल-नेमि down… felling that faceless, armless truck of that demon so far vaulting on the sky onto earth in one fell swoop…",
